From: Curium <curium@appautomaton.dev>
Subject: [PATCH] ios: headless Curium Blink shell, extension V2 bridge, and download routing

Routes SceneController into a pure headless Browser + CuriumBrowserHost when
CrIOSEngineBootstrap has a registered Swift shell delegate, skips Chrome UI
BrowserAgents / ProfileAgents / BrowserKit multi-process appex targets, lazily
initializes SceneDelegate window when launched without a Chrome storyboard,
isolates downloads per-WebState via CuriumDownloadRouter, hardens
popup/file-chooser/cookie-clear paths, and exports CrIOSExtensionManagerV1 V2
toolbar/popup/DNR/command APIs.

---
